{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117135","id":3361846352,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7IYbRQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117135","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117135.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117135.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117135","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117135/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117135/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117135/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c85ada054b2d69b5926817d8d5c46cf1ab4d5fbc","number":117135,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Set accessibility name on Tree inline cell editor when editing","user":{"login":"marcomolinaleija","id":141619450,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHDw-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141619450?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija","html_url":"https://github.com/marcomolinaleija","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcomolinaleija/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes #110417.\n\nWhen editing a `Tree` item inline — e.g. renaming a node in the Scene dock via **F2** — a `LineEdit` (or `TextEdit` for multiline cells) appears inside a `Popup`. This editor had no `accessibility_name` set, so screen readers had nothing to announce when it received focus.\n\nFor comparison, the search box in the **Add Node** dialog works correctly because it has a `placeholder_text` which `LineEdit` uses as its accessible name (see `NOTIFICATION_ACCESSIBILITY_UPDATE` in `line_edit.cpp`).\n\n**Fix:** in `Tree::edit_selected()`, set the accessibility name on `line_editor` / `text_editor` before `grab_focus()`:\n- Use the column's translated title (`xl_title`) if one is set.\n- Fall back to the item's current text (e.g. the node name) so the screen reader announces context like *\"Node2D, edit text\"*.\n\nBoth the single-line (`CELL_MODE_STRING`) and multiline cases are fixed.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The column title fallback to item text is intentional: the Scene dock tree has no column title, so using the node name gives the user clear context about what they are editing.\n- Tested that the fix compiles cleanly. Runtime verification with a screen reader (NVDA/Narrator) is needed to confirm the announcement behavior.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":133230311